  "details": "When using a QVPen (probably happens with other pens too), over a Sprite Renderer, the trail will disappear depending on the angle/distance with the text/sprite (as shown on gif linked below).\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1020515361566761110/1312432584357318726/Recording_2024-11-30_at_15.56.50.gif?ex=674c7997&is=674b2817&hm=4264b5966853a3b68a1e95d0f68db72fc5f19539c3a0aaaa8613c6aede9fdcee&\n\nTested on Quest, not reproduced on Android Phone, can't test on Pico (don't have one or a user nearby to test).\n\nCan be reproduced on this world : https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_f9e8d29e-3b09-4d82-b48b-102f5c8688b0 (World map has been converted from sprite to quad to workaround the problem, but alphabets on the side are still with the issue).",
